              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Yosuwa geto migam wi Got Ebal ri Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka Musa ŋeca pa Rwoth oyido ooro Joisiraili, paka ondiki i kitawo ma cik pa Musa, migam ma telin ma dhano fodi k'oketho cuma moro kwoŋe; to jomiy'iye mic awaŋa ri Rwoth, to jomiyo cowirok ma siem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kenyo i nyim Joisiraili, ondiko i wi telin nyawoti cik pa Musa, m'oyido otieko ndiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Joisiraili je, jokicar kodi jopiny, jodongo kodi jotel gi jothum banja pajo, jocungo yuthenge m'oŋiyere gi kakan ruwaŋ jocway ri Were i wi migam ma Jolevi ma jotiŋo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth, adec kwoŋ jo ruwaŋ Got Gerizim aka adec man kwoŋ jo ruwaŋ Got Ebal, paka Musa ŋeca pa Rwoth oyido kutho owodho or, ni joripo miyo Joisiraili silwany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka rumacen mere to soma wac je ma cik, silwany kodi kwoŋ, paka nitie i gimoro je m'ondiki i kitawo ma cik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye wac kwoŋ gima Musa owodho or ma Yosuwa k'osoma ruwaŋ cokirok je ma Isiraili, kanyacel gi mon, nyithindho kodi jokicar ma jobedo i dier jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
